## Changes Made

The proposed workflow uses the exact reviewed source folder, immutable checkout
and artifact action commits, contents:read, one branch/path trigger, no secrets,
and no image publication. Its future driver creates and inspects a new UUID-labelled
container and two exclusive volumes before detached START. All nine literal
mounts, runtime environment, immutable actual image, resource limits and terminal
state are checked. Git is byte backing only; the future native filesystem supplies
fresh identities. Nothing adopts expired CI2, emulated repair2, old9ff or C7 custody.

The source controller holds current manifest/source/runtime FDs before use,
records complete EOF hashes and all nine fields, native pidfd operations,
O_PATH literal-link observations, Python import origins and readable maps. The
new Node launcher checks exact kernel argv, current sources, load hooks, maps,
EOF hashes and FD retirement while executing the byte-exact original20 OWN
control bodies. The original81 candidate JS files are copied unchanged. The
exact unchanged48 producer controls then use a fresh separate volume and the
original required canonical guestROOT. These48 remain public synthetic source
controls even on a native kernel. Capability children and the original public
bootstrap retain separate process obligations; this proposal does not qualify
the v6 whole-recorder/descendant source closure or eight compiler recipes.

The manifest is held before its first parse. Strict fields, unique ordered rows,
declared total bytes, no-follow complete membership, explicit directory-symlink
denial, current directory fences and unchanged full-nine pins are enforced. The
remote export boundary validates exact fixed paths, ordinary one-link files,
full EOF/nine-field rows, integer fields, raw SHA names, byte sums, row uniqueness
and all required membership before any member copy. Export copies drain bounded
tar/pipe streams with actual pidfd ownership, exact EOF, deadline and close guards.
Failed outputs remain. Host write/copy budgets are checked before effects.

